---
title: 'Artist Talk: FEAR – LESS – HOPE: Framing Time'
type: Artist Talk
date: 2025-10-12
time: 16:00–18:00
location: bromberghof
exhibition: fear-less-hope-framing-time
---
Vahram Aghasyan, Greta Harutyunyan, Anas Kahal and Johannes Weilandt discuss with the curatorial team how working with video, images and archives finds its way into the artworks.

The conversation will be held in English.
